<title>USA: Univ. of Alabama, $9.915 mln won by Raymond James.</title>
<headline>Univ. of Alabama, $9.915 mln won by Raymond James.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James said it won $9.915 million of University of Alabama, auxiliary revenue bonds, (Taxable), with a net interest cost of 6.466 percent.</p>
</text>
